@startuml
title Truoc khi sua: USB joystick khong dieu khien duoc gimbal

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Operator
component "USB joystick\nARGOSDYNE DR-1000" as USB
component "Joystick::_handleAxis()" as Joystick
component "Joystick log" as Log
component "Vehicle::sendJoystickDataThreadSafe()" as ManualControl
component "Flight controller" as FlightController
component "R3 gimbal" as Gimbal

Operator --> USB : Move pitch or yaw stick
USB --> Joystick : Raw HID axes
Joystick --> Log : Gimbal values used only for logging
Joystick --> ManualControl : Roll, pitch, yaw, throttle
ManualControl --> FlightController : MANUAL_CONTROL
Joystick -[#red,dashed]-> Gimbal : No gimbal command

note bottom of Joystick
  Auto-calibration could map noisy axes incorrectly.
  Gimbal values were not connected to camera control.
  MANUAL_CONTROL controls the aircraft, not the R3 gimbal.
end note

@enduml
